# Scoped to macOS/ — keeps Unix line endings on files executed by a shell here.
# CRLF breaks the shebang / `bash` parsing on macOS. The repo is developed on
# Windows, so without this git's autocrlf could rewrite them on checkout.
# Lives inside macOS/ (not repo root) so the Mac port leaves the rest of the
# repo's checkout behavior completely alone.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.command   text eol=lf
